cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated thesis."
title: "Estimating Future Energy Storage Requirements for Renewable Integration in Europe: A Gap-Filling Approach Using Machine Learning"
abstract: >
  Analysis pipeline for a gap-filling study using machine learning of European energy
  storage projections. Estimates log-log OLS elasticities of storage and
  battery capacity on VRE share, runs a multivariate diagnostic on solar
  and wind capacity, and uses ElasticNet vs Random Forest with leave-one-out
  cross-validation to impute storage and battery values for scenarios that
  report the drivers without publishing the target.
